  "clarifications": [
    "Workspace revisions are non-negative safe integers; dataset revisions are opaque provider-owned strings.",
    "Operation outputs are objects. instrument.search wraps its array in instruments.",
    "Worker hello is unsolicited; the host validates the exact negotiated protocol and expected role before sending work.",
    "Cancel references request_id; heartbeat has only common envelope fields.",
    "Schema definitions are canonical. Small per-operation schemas and all language types are generated from them.",
    "Metadata, params, provenance and error details are explicit data bags; they never confer authority.",
    "Schema validation is structural. Cross-field market invariants, AST budgets, role authorization and response correlation require application validation.",
    "Specifying a payload does not expose or implement that operation. Unsupported operations fail closed."
  ],
